Zuljanah, zuljanah..(2)<br>
Khali aaya hai shabbir ka zuljanah<br>
Zuljanah, zuljanah<br>
<br>
zuljanah se sakina ne rokar kaha<br>
<br>
1. Kyu hai baage kati, jism zakhmi tera<br>
zeen khali hai kyu, aur sar hai jhuka<br>
bolta kyu nahi, chup hai teri zabaa'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
2. Tere payro'n se lipti mai kehti rahi<br>
baad baba ke mai jee nahi paungi<br>
mere baba ko tu, chhod aaya kaha'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
3. Ab tamacho'n se mujhko bachayega kaun<br>
mujhko seene pe apne sulayega kaun<br>
is yatimi mein ab, kaun hai sayebaa'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
4. Jis tarha mere saare sahare gaye<br>
tu bata kya mere baba maare gaye<br>
kyu teri aankh se, hai ye aansu rawaa'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
5. Kund khanjar chalane laga jab laee'n<br>
mere baba ko paani diya kya nahi?<br>
yaa dame zibha bhi, the wo tishna daha'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
6. Mujhko batla gaye zakhm tere hai jo<br>
itna zakhmi hai tu, kitne zakhmi the woh<br>
teer kitne lage, kis qadar barchiya'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
7. Dard furqat se dil mera phat jaega<br>
apne baba ke seene pe chayn aayega<br>
hai jaha'n babajaa'n, mujhko le chal waha'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
<br>
8. Haye farhan o mazhar, sakina dukhi<br>
zuljanah se lipat kar wo roti rahi<br>
keh rahi thi ye masoom ki siskiya'n<br>
zuljanah, zuljanah hai kaha'n baba jaa'n..(2)<br>
Zuljanah, zuljanah..(4)